<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 19.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 19.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   92/94     99/101    UNQ    158/160</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  95/97    101/103  175/180  185/190</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes ended steady on Thursday with both buyers and sellers unwilling to meet each others' levels, traders said. They said trade was furthur hampered by berth congestions which are expected to last until the end of June. A 380-cst cargo was heard traded at around $97/T.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
